      ],
      "notes": "Distinct confirmed selected-gun sound reset with visible learned/calibration counts and result; whole-library backup export/import; supported per-gun Noise Filter/Auto Gain and device-wide themes/vibration. A separate Delete all guns & app data action states every store deleted, recommends exporting first, and requires confirmation before atomic reset/restart. Cancel deletes nothing. Sound reset retains guns, presets/results and other guns. Unsupported capabilities are disclosed; Install explains local-data and microphone limits. Device capability status stays in Settings; About is reached independently from the shared app footer. CHG-035 private preview adds Test as Free/Full, a mode indicator, Free default/private remembered preference and activity/data guards; public output omits them.",
